n_engine_integration_plan_py_036_037", "label": "PY-036/037 Engineering Decision Report Subsystem", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Called the most under-used thing in the codebase: a full reporting framework with sections and a pluggable ReportRenderer that no endpoint on any API version exposes."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_track_a", "label": "Track A - Finish the Python Edges", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_track_b", "label": "Track B - Move Java to v2", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A hard prerequisite for everything on the Java side and independent of Track A, so the two can run in parallel with different people."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_track_c", "label": "Track C - Java Consumes and Persists", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_track_d", "label": "Track D - Surfacing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_track_e", "label": "Track E - Parcel Commercial Data", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The long pole: nothing in the land engine produces a real answer without owner identity, availability status and transaction options, and it needs a migration, an ingestion path and an admin UI."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_a1_emit_cable_sizing", "label": "A1 Emit Per-Segment Cable Sizing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_a2_emit_land_decision", "label": "A2 Emit the Land Decision, Not Just the Count", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_a3_reachable_micro_siting", "label": "A3 Make Micro-Siting Reachable", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_a4_expose_engineering_report", "label": "A4 Expose the Engineering Report", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_b1_repoint_client", "label": "B1 Repoint PythonOptimizationClient at /api/v2/optimise", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "v1 is a compatibility shim (land_context is v2-only and the richer response lives in v2). This is the change most likely to regress working behaviour, so the golden-fixture contract test should be extended before the switch, not after; v2's four-value status is richer than v1's two-value status which existing failure handling collapses."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_e1_extend_parcel_model", "label": "E1 Extend the Parcel Model", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "owner_id ranks first because without a stable owner identity, owner-contact minimisation counts parcels, calls them owners, and still returns a plausible number."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_report_ownership_split", "label": "Report Ownership Split - Python Reasons, Java Renders", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two reporting subsystems are both growing. Python owns the reasoning because it has the candidates, deltas and loss causes Java cannot reconstruct; Java owns the document because it has the project, assets, coordinates and export path. Two implementations of one answer is the failure already on record for right-of-way area."}, {"id": "docs_artifacts_python_engine_integration_plan_ci_verification_gap", "label": "CI Verification Gap During the Merge Window", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/artifacts/Python Engine Integration Plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CI was off while all of PY-030..PY-037 merged: .github/ was deleted and gitignored and twenty-six commits landed unverified, so the Python job's first run